# Only what the build needs is in the repository (an allow-list). Your disc image and game files, the packages you
# build (out/: a full package holds your game), logs, clips, the decompilation's output (decomp/: names and offsets
# read from your default.xex), private notes and your own pictures (sce_sys/local/, art/) stay out.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/CREDITS.md
!/LICENSE
!/docs/
!/patches/
!/scripts/
!/sce_sys/
!/tools/
/sce_sys/local/
__pycache__/
